flowchart LR
    I[Coordinator: five-file inputs or synthetic demo] --> S[Parent FastAPI session]
    S --> C[Canonical case and constraints]
    C --> A[Strands agent: native Ollama and pinned local Qwen]
    A --> T[Six allowlisted tools]
    T --> I1[inspect_case]
    T --> SO[solve_schedule]
    T --> D[diagnose_infeasibility]
    T --> P[propose_change]
    T --> SM[simulate_change]
    T --> R[prepare_review]
    SO --> V[Independent verifier]
    SM --> V
    V --> S
    S --> H{Coordinator confirmation}
    H -->|apply proposal| C
    H -->|approve verified schedule| E[Deterministic ZIP export]
    E --> O[CSV, JSON, verification and iCalendar snapshots]
